<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 30.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 30.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
